    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center; width: 32%">AGAINST</TD>
    <TD STYLE="padding-bottom: 1.5pt; width: 2%">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="border-bottom: black 1.5pt solid; text-align: center; width: 32%">ABSTAIN</TD></TR>
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom; background-color: #CCEEFF">
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">96,401,205</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">59,128</TD>
    <TD>&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD STYLE="text-align: center">500</TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0"><B>Proposal No. 2. </B><FONT STYLE="font-size: 10pt">At the Meeting,
the vote to approve the Company&rsquo;s Fourth Amended and Restated Memorandum and Articles of Association, was as follows: </FONT></P>

